# Listing 6.3 — OWL property characteristics and disjointness
@prefix ex:  <http://example.org/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

ex:ancestorOf  a owl:TransitiveProperty .   # A→B and B→C imply A→C
ex:spouseOf    a owl:SymmetricProperty .    # A→B implies B→A
ex:parentOf    owl:inverseOf ex:childOf .   # each implies the other
ex:Person      owl:disjointWith ex:Organization .  # nothing is both
